WP05 contract proof

Added:
- App/game inventory primitive enums for source kind, detection state, custody
  state, category kind, and source refs.
- AppGameInventoryEvidenceRowSchema with source, custody, product kind,
  identity refs, category candidates, capability state, stale and
  permission-limited states, and explicit no-use guard fields.
- Inventory evidence row schemas live in
  packages/activity-domain/src/app-game-inventory.ts and are re-exported through
  packages/activity-domain/src/app-game.ts.
- AppGameInventoryCategoryCandidateSchema for category candidates with evidence
  refs and confidence.
- Focused tests in packages/activity-domain/tests/app-game-inventory.test.ts.

Proof cases:
- Launcher manifest inventory can describe an installed native game without use
  claims.
- Inventory rows reject running, foreground, or duration claims.
- Launcher-installed rows do not become gameplay rows.
- Permission-limited and stale inventory states are preserved.
- Source kinds must cite matching refs.
- High-confidence display-only inventory is rejected.
